Package: BLT
Title: Time Series Helpers for Working with BLT Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Amelia", "McNamara", , "amelia.mcnamara@stthomas.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This is a demo package for the "Code you can bank on" 
    workshop at the Federal Reserve. Helper functions for working 
    with time series data, especially data about bacon, lettuce, 
    and tomatoes. 
